Package: kubeos-control-plane
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, ca-certificates
Description: KubeOS control plane: apiserver, controller-manager, scheduler, proxy, etcd
 The five control-plane binaries and etcd, run as host systemd services instead of
 static Pods, which is why a freshly booted KubeOS node shows no Pods at all
 (docs/NATIVE-CONTROL-PLANE.md). kubelet, kubectl and kubeadm are not duplicated here:
 they come from the pkgs.k8s.io packages and stay in /usr/bin.
 .
 No Debian package provides these binaries, so the official release builds are fetched
 at build time and verified against the checksums upstream publishes. The units carry a
 ConditionPathExists on the PKI, so an un-initialised or de-clustered machine skips them
 cleanly instead of crash-looping.
